s - neither CO) and unpopulated CMS placeholder blocks ('Property Name 1, property city, st') - no real searchable directory. https://www.assetliving.com/resources/case-studies lists only 5 case studies total (Destin FL, Tempe AZ, Kansas City MO, Phoenix AZ, Houston TX), none in Colorado. No CO communities captured for this operator. Embrey: worked - full portfolio (only ~8 properties nationwide) visible directly on homepage and https://www.embrey.com/portfolio/, no search needed. Found 2 CO communities: Encore at Boulevard One (Denver, marked SOLD, has own site encoreatboulevardone.com) and The Sullivan (Littleton, marked UNDER CONSTRUCTION, no live marketing site yet - only generic leasing.embreydc.com portal found). Bozzuto: worked - direct state-filtered URL https://www.bozzuto.com/apartments-for-rent/co listed all 4 CO communities in one page ('Showing 4 Results'): Aera RiNo (Denver), Arden Englewood (Englewood), The Hartwell (Denver), The Magwood (Boulder). Each property page has a 'Property Website' link to its own marketing domain, extracted from each.",
